      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>That's a good start, but it's a bit high-level. I need more ammunition for the actual debate stage. Can you get more specific? For example, when they talk about wealth redistribution or universal basic income, what are the specific economic or moral contradictions we can point to that make those policies unworkable? Give me the \"gotcha\" points that show their logic is fundamentally broken.",
