      "content": "That's exactly what I'm looking for. It sounds like once you peel back the layers, most of their platform is built on these shaky assumptions. To wrap this up, just give me a quick summary of why their worldview is ultimately doomed to fail compared to a more market-oriented approach. Basically, give me the absolute bottom line on why their logic just doesn't hold up.",
